type: HeatCrafter
name: Peroxate Refinery
description: It electrifies and heats the mycelial exudate to extremely high temperatures in order to purify it, transforming it into peroxate, a substance so energetic that it corrodes most materials.
size: 3
heatRequirement: 35
liquidCapacity: 30
craftTime: 600
squareSprite: false
hasPower: true
